<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Suppose</p>

<p>
<md>\mathbb{E}[\widehat{\theta}]
=
\theta+\frac1n.</md>
</p>

<p>Find the bias.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Suppose an estimator has variance</p>

<p>
<md>\frac4n</md>
</p>

<p>and bias</p>

<p>
<md>\frac1n.</md>
</p>

<p>Find its MSE.</p>
